# Our spam/ham corpus stays local. It holds comments harvested from real
# namespaces, and it is our labelled answer key: publishing it hands an
# adversary both our users' words and the exact set of posts we judged. The
# blanket *.json rule above already covers it; this is explicit so the reason
# survives a change to that rule.
scripts/spam/corpus.json
